# Integrated clock allocation is invariant across the qualified 1/2/4/8-worker pool.
@phase 6.3
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< setoption name Threads value 1
< position startpos
< go wtime 10000 btime 10000 depth 4
! allow-info begin
> info string time optimum_ms 260 maximum_ms 1115 root {{U64}} stability {{U64}} score {{U64}} effort {{U64}} smp {{U64}} combined {{U64}} ponder_credit_ns {{U64}} helper_events {{U64}} helpers 0 target_ns {{U64}} reason search_complete hard_overshoot_ns 0
> {{BESTMOVE_LINE}}
! allow-info end
< setoption name Threads value 2
< ucinewgame
< position startpos
< go wtime 10000 btime 10000 depth 4
! allow-info begin
> info string time optimum_ms 260 maximum_ms 1115 root {{U64}} stability {{U64}} score {{U64}} effort {{U64}} smp {{U64}} combined {{U64}} ponder_credit_ns {{U64}} helper_events {{U64}} helpers 1 target_ns {{U64}} reason search_complete hard_overshoot_ns 0
> {{BESTMOVE_LINE}}
! allow-info end
< setoption name Threads value 4
< ucinewgame
< position startpos
< go wtime 10000 btime 10000 depth 4
! allow-info begin
> info string time optimum_ms 260 maximum_ms 1115 root {{U64}} stability {{U64}} score {{U64}} effort {{U64}} smp {{U64}} combined {{U64}} ponder_credit_ns {{U64}} helper_events {{U64}} helpers 3 target_ns {{U64}} reason search_complete hard_overshoot_ns 0
> {{BESTMOVE_LINE}}
! allow-info end
< setoption name Threads value 8
< ucinewgame
< position startpos
< go wtime 10000 btime 10000 depth 4
! allow-info begin
> info string time optimum_ms 260 maximum_ms 1115 root {{U64}} stability {{U64}} score {{U64}} effort {{U64}} smp {{U64}} combined {{U64}} ponder_credit_ns {{U64}} helper_events {{U64}} helpers 7 target_ns {{U64}} reason search_complete hard_overshoot_ns 0
> {{BESTMOVE_LINE}}
! allow-info end
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
